    "runId": "55f8ba9f-d0b7-40ff-88ef-578e9cb1bb5b",
    "goal": "Add per-participant expense categories to the expense splitter so the group can see spending by category.\n\nRequirements:\n1. Domain: add an optional category field to Expense (a non-empty string when present) and a computeCategoryTotals(expenses) function returning total cents per category, including an \"uncategorized\" bucket for expenses without one.\n2. API: allow addExpense to accept a category and expose listCategoryTotals(store).\n3. Web: add renderCategoryBreakdown(totals) that renders one line per category as \"<category>: $<amount>\", sorted by descending amount.\n4. Tests: cover the new domain, api and web behavior in tests/.\n\nKeep the existing balance behavior and all current tests passing.",
